In half, neatly filling the void inside the padded fleece outer ring of the bed, with only her very fluffy, fox-like tail protruding. " height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/bsag/6ac8bb391d875.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://bsag.some.pics"&gt;@bsag&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 10:00:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>书店猫！这张图片背后的故事在alt文本里 :)</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac89bc57e468</link><description>&lt;p&gt;书店猫！这张图片背后的故事在alt文本里 :)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="am sorting through my pictures and came across this one, taken in the book village of Bredevoort, NL back in 2007. 

I walked into one of the bookstores and saw this cat. He was rather grumpy. I waited for a while for him to sit and pose for me, and then just gave up and took a picture of him and walked away. 

And then I turned around and he sat picture perfect ready. I walked back to take a picture, and then he took off! 

Cats!
" height="2816" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6ac89bc57e468.jpg" width="2112"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 07:46:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>雨中晨跑</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac88e662d40c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;🏃🏻 雨中晨跑。👌🏻&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A wet wooden boardwalk runs through a dense green forest, with leaves scattered on the planks. In the lower left foreground, a purple outline of a running route and a small purple circle with a running figure are overlaid. A purple caption bar with text is partially visible at the bottom." height="1486" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6ac88e662d40c.jpg" width="1179"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 06:49:13 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>周一傍晚骑车时，看到了壮丽的天空和曙暮辉（我还特意查了一下这个词）。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac86be4103cf</link><description>&lt;p&gt;周一傍晚骑车时，看到了壮丽的天空和曙暮辉（我还特意查了一下这个词）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Photo that includes some of the tree line, but mostly the sky. The sun is low, almost sunset, and just about visible in the lower right part of the frame. The rays of the sun are visible across the sky, with lines of light and dark cast by the small, low clouds. Some internet searching tells me these are called “Crepuscular rays”." height="4003" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/tonymottaz/6ac86be4103cf.jpg" width="6480"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://tonymottaz.some.pics"&gt;@tonymottaz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 04:22:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>时髦的人喜欢淘二手货</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac8662207f96</link><description>&lt;p&gt;时髦的人喜欢淘二手货&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A sign outside a bazaar, it reads: “Cool people love thrifting”" height="3226" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/axel/6ac8662207f96.jpg" width="2421"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://axel.some.pics"&gt;@axel&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 03:57:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>电量不足</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac853f63044f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;电量不足&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A small black and white dog sleeps propped on the side of her bed, on top of a blue sleeping bag." height="1850" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jinx/6ac853f63044f.jpg" width="3083"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jinx.some.pics"&gt;@jinx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 02:39:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>新蘸水笔尖到手</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac84fa5746af</link><description>&lt;p&gt;新蘸水笔尖日。🙂&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="An aluminum dip nib sitting in its paper card packaging, labeled Lil’ Dipper" height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jezlyn/6ac84fa5746af.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jezlyn.some.pics"&gt;@jezlyn&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 02:21:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>安息吧，玛格丽特·汉密尔顿</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac836bf7e579</link><description>&lt;p&gt;安息吧，玛格丽特·汉密尔顿&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="LEGO Margaret Hamilton figure beside stacked blue and white bricks representing books, the background panels show a moon and rocket." height="3739" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6ac836bf7e579.jpg" width="4985"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 00:35:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>标志的背面。</title><link>https://some.pics/6ac8191959ac9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;标志的背面。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Back of a sign." height="3000"